'''Filibuster Invasion Outbreak''' is an [[Invasion Stage]] in [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 3. It temporarily overrides a random stage after completing all [[Zombie Outbreaks]] and [[A Whole New World]]. Upon completion, it awards a [[Legend Capsules (Gacha Event)|Legend Ticket]] and [[Filibuster Cat X (Special Cat)|Metafilibuster]]'s [[Talents]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

